<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 108,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 108,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual receipts 108,000 head at interior Iowa/so Minnesota, versus an estimate of 100,000 head. Saturday actual was 34,000 head versus an estimate of 15,000 head.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts steady to $0.50 lower than  mid-session Friday.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>			   Country		    Plants</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    52.00 -53.50	   53.00 -54.50</p>
<p>few			51.50  54.00	   52.50  55.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to $2.00 higher.</p>
